					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>diseased in the joints, gouty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Damox.
				2.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Fam.</u>
				9.23
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -κά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					7.100
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀλήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					17(2).125
				</span></i>
			.</div>
